description: Forbid Co-authored-by Cursor on every LockOn Bridge commit/push.
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor co-author (LockOn Bridge)

- **Never** include `Co-authored-by: Cursor` / `cursoragent@cursor.com` in commits.
- After commit: `git log -1 --format=%B` must be clean before any push.
- If Cursor injected a trailer: rewrite via `commit-tree` (not amend) or
  `git filter-repo` message callback, then push only the cleaned history.
- Author/committer stay `blushful8` only.
